[h2]Build 0.9.26[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Mover mode[/b] for conveyor arms (the mode button now cycles Loader, Feeder, Mover). A Mover simply moves things from its gripper side to the cell behind it, whatever is on either side - a passing belt, storage, a hopper or bare floor - as long as there is room. Anything a belt drops on its own cell is moved on too. No network and no machine needed.
[*]A Mover has a [b]What to move[/b] filter, so you choose exactly what it moves; everything else is left alone. It starts allowing everything. Moving into storage respects that storage's own settings.
[*]Movers have their own lime-green look.
[/list]
